{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1RoZSUyMFRveGljJTIwQXZlbmdlciUyMFRoZSUyME11c2ljYWwlMjAlMjgyMDE4JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"The Toxic Avenger The Musical","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/b2auzpNt6Vk4vbJQ4zA1bMPvQ1W.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l5JMz8whHg0hZfWVxt5UZVx89uY.jpg","description":"Based on Lloyd Kaufman’s cult 1984 comedy film, The Toxic Avenger The Musical tells the story of the citizens of Tromaville who are crying out for a hero. Enter nerdy Melvin Ferd the Third, an aspiring earth scientist, determined to clean up the state’s major toxic waste problem. When a corrupt Mayor and her government goons get wind of his plans, they vow to stop this heroic feat. Melvin is attacked and tossed into a vat of toxic waste... transforming him instantly into The Toxic Avenger, New Jersey’s first superhero! Toxie is a 7-foot mutant freak with superhuman strength and a supersized heart to match. His aims are to save heavily polluted New Jersey, end global warming, win the heart of the prettiest (blindest) librarian in town - and get home in time for dinner!\n\nReleased 8 Apr 2018 · United States of America · Language: English · 121 min\nStudio: BroadwayHD, Troma Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Comedy","Horror","Science Fiction","Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"121 min","cast":["Ben Irish","Natalie Hope","Emma Salvo","Oscar Conlon-Morrey","Ché"],"director":["Benji Sperring","Nick Morris"],"released":"2018-04-08T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Benji Sperring","character":"Director"},{"name":"Ben Irish","character":"Melvin / The Toxic Avenger","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rqP0JUNyPlhJteVItE8ctwCu6zF.jpg"},{"name":"Natalie Hope","character":"The Mayor / Melvins mom / A nun","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3IHhQXa41YwJj21gOFav7PThLGO.jpg"},{"name":"Emma Salvo","character":"Sarah","phot